                    (e.g. WHEAT 308 L x 0.30 = 92.4 per ha, MAIZE 600 L x 0.30 = 180).
        Not changed on purpose: root crops, pea and vegetable yields (conditional targets, not verified),
        POTATO / SUGARCANE seed (own fillType), spinach yield, all grass / forage / straw yields. -->
